                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Visualize a probed scalar field — CO2, temperature, age of air, Cp, pressure — as a colored point cloud, a heatmap mesh, or a translucent volumetric cloud. Feed the Probe component's points and one value per point. For velocity, use the Vector Field Viewer.

