                      </chunks>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="param_input" index="1">
                      <items count="8">
                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item>
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Sample points (e.g. the probe points). Empty with a Mesh wired uses the mesh's samples: its vertices when it has one per value (the WRF Probe's Mesh) or its face centres when it has one face per value (the square probe markers of Deconstruct MRT and Deconstruct Wind), in Values order — so mesh-only wiring is complete.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">6e85116b-3228-4c2d-96c3-17db96e0c2e0</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Points</item>
                        <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">P</item>
